The complete gate run caught one more real weakness: one of eight exact-CSP attacks solved the promoted easy preset within 300,000 nodes. I’m discarding that rung too and fixing the team length at 24 while enlarging only the decoy pools (32, 40, 48 heroes per pool). That keeps the answer and 276 pair checks fixed while growing the search space—the intended “haystack, not needle” scaling.
